        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Coming soon – Berwick Pines, Foxrock, Dublin 18, home to the world famous racecourse and located right next to Foxrock Village as well as Dublin’s major business district in Sandyford.\r\n\r\nBerwick Pines is an extraordinary development of one, two and three bedroom apartments and penthouses by Homeland, available exclusively through Knight Frank.\r\n\r\nIdeally  located on Leopardstown Road, Berwick Pines has lots of restaurants, coffee shops, supermarkets and specialist retailers all close by, as well as larger retail parks in easy reach.\r\n\r\nLeisure amenities include Leopardstown park, local Gaa pitches, tennis clubs, golf clubs and gyms.\r\n\r\nRegister your interest to be contacted about our upcoming launch.\r\n\r\nFor further information or to register to your interest contact, Your Partners in Property, Knight Frank New Homes on newhomes@knightfrank.ie or (01) 237 4500\r\n\r\nPSR No. 001880"
      },
